          <span class="fc-delta no-move">Δ 0pp from 72% (2026-07-20)</span>
          <span class="fc-horizon">→ resolves by 2026-10-27</span>
        </div>
        <div class="fc-delta-reason">New forecast. p=0.72 (Judge concurs with analyst). 25th Knesset dissolved July 17 by 62-0 vote; Central Elections Committee confirmed October 27. Israel held elections under active conflict in 2003, 2006, and 2021. Primary risks: (a) massive Iranian strike on Israeli civilian population centers — Iran currently targeting US bases, not Israeli cities, assessed ~0.20 over 99 days; (b) Supreme Court injunction — assessed low; (c) infrastructure destruction. None imminent.</div>
        <dl class="fc-meta-row">
