          <dt>Sources OK</dt><dd>Israeli Central Elections Committee announcement, or Times of Israel/Haaretz/Jerusalem Post TIER1 reporting of election-day proceedings.</dd>
          <dt>Ambiguity</dt><dd>If election proceeds in most of the country but suspended in specific regions (≤5% of polling stations) due to active bombardment: resolve YES if Central Elections Committee certifies the result. If ≥5% stations suspended = AMBIGUOUS pending make-up vote determination.</dd>
        </dl>
